      "clause": "clu-feature-dependencies-mediatype-application-vnd-oci-image-manifest-v1-io-e17c68d7",
      "disposition": "non-testable",
      "rationale": "A fragment of an example OCI manifest showing where a published Feature's serialized metadata annotation sits. The media type belongs to the OCI distribution spec, is negotiated inside deacon's registry client, and is not reported by any consumer subcommand; nothing in stdout, an exit code, the filesystem or the container graph changes with it."
