      "clause": "clu-feature-dependencies-start-with-all-the-elements-from-b2-in-a-worklis-algo-e03a3c04",
      "disposition": "non-testable",
      "rationale": "The initialization line of the round-based sort: seed the worklist, start with an empty installation order. It fixes no outcome — every step that can change the resulting order is a separate clause, mapped to the two order behaviors — and an intermediate worklist has no observable form."
