    {
      "id": "clc-feature-dependencies-the-orchestrating-tool-must-fallback-to-download-must-e98c49b3",
      "clause": "clu-feature-dependencies-the-orchestrating-tool-must-fallback-to-download-must-e98c49b3",
      "disposition": "non-testable",
      "rationale": "A fallback obligation for an optimization deacon does not implement: when the registry does not carry the serialized `devcontainer-feature.json` annotation, the tool MUST download and extract the Feature to read its metadata. deacon has no annotation fast path at all (no annotation handling in crates/core/src/oci), so extracting the Feature IS its only path and no observation distinguishes 'fell back' from 'never optimized'. The outcome the clause protects — a Feature resolving from a registry without the annotation — is claimed by bhv-up-feature-install-order."
    },
